.TH GETEUID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
geteuid \- returns the calling process's effective user id
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B uid_t geteuid(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns the calling process's effective user ID.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the value described above; errno is not modified.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR geteuid (2)
